WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.476 --> 00:00:10.597
Today’s task: two rectangles from the same 12 tiles.

2
00:00:10.597 --> 00:00:17.239
Each tap adds a tile. The total up top is the area: 12.

3
00:00:17.239 --> 00:00:21.149
Fit brings everything into view. Plus and minus zoom.

4
00:00:21.149 --> 00:00:23.950
Drag across empty space to select several tiles.

5
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:26.416
Drag one, and they all move. Now it is 3 by 4.

6
00:00:26.416 --> 00:00:29.873
Same area, but the perimeter went from 16 to 14.

7
00:00:29.873 --> 00:00:34.457
Hold a tile for Copy, Fill, Lock and Delete.

8
00:00:34.457 --> 00:00:43.039
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
